# Five syntax errors, all reported in one run thanks to panic-mode recovery.

SUBJECT admin, guest
RESOURCE database SUPPORTS READ, WRITE

ALLOW admin FLY database                              # FLY is not an action
DENY guest WRITE                                      # resource name missing
ALLOW admin READ database WHEN (authenticated AND mfa # missing ')'
ALLOW guest READ database;                            # ';' is not part of the language
allow guest READ database                             # keywords are uppercase
